Troubleshooting
Issue: Module not found error

Solution: Ensure you're in the correct directory (~/nlp-requirement-tool)
Run: pwd to verify location
Issue: Permission denied

Solution: Make scripts executable with chmod +x script_name.py
Issue: No output from parser

Solution: Check that action verbs match those in the action_verbs list
Verify requirement strings are lowercase
Issue: Generated functions don't work

Solution: Remember that generated templates are starter code only
You must implement the actual logic in each function
